        <media:content url="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/6/20231121_154339.jpg" medium="image" />

        <updated>2026-11-14T21:32:29+00:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/6/20231121_154339.jpg" alt="" />
                    Barcelona broke the afternoon Into a thousand coloured shards And laid them&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/6/20231121_154339.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p>Barcelona broke the afternoon<br>Into a thousand coloured shards<br>And laid them across the beach.</p>
<p>You stole pieces of sunlight<br>Carried them in your laughter.<br>While the Mediterranean, restless,<br>Counted our miles in waves.</p>
<p>When the city awakens<br>A thousand eyes in the trees<br>We will return again<br>To make the sunlight whole.</p>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title>Minotaur</title>
        <author>
            <name>Finbarre Snarey</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/minotaur.html"/>
        <id>https://happybirthdayivonne.com/minotaur.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/5/IMG_2708.jpg" medium="image" />

        <updated>2026-11-14T21:14:48+00:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/5/IMG_2708.jpg" alt="" />
                    As a single bead of wine Trickles across mosaic lines I traverse&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://happybirthdayivonne.com/media/posts/5/IMG_2708.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As a single bead of wine <br>Trickles across mosaic lines <br>I traverse anfractuous streets <br>Labyrinthine, except <br>Time unravels like golden twine <br>Behooving me to be bullish <br>My champagne bottle, swinging Clublike. <br>It's eleven thirty nine.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">My grin in the thought of our sinning <br>Curves to match the hornshaped moon. <br>To the palatial hotel of fine china vases <br>Lavish destruction begins in your room.</span></p>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
